#. +> trunk stable
#: standard_actions_module.cpp:136
msgid ""
"The changes have been saved. Please consider:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Applications need to be restarted to see the changes.</li>"
"    "
"<li>This change could introduce shortcut conflicts in some applications.</li>"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"De Ännern wöörn sekert. Beacht bitte:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Du muttst Programmen nieg starten, ehr se de Ännern övernehmt.</li>"
"   "
"<li>Na de Ännern kunn dat binnen Programmen Konflikten bi de Tastkombinatschonen geven.</li>"
"</ul>"
